# MT759 demand withdrawal (simulator convention - no dedicated MT since SR2021; MX = tsrv.017):
# 23H OTHERFNC, 45D contains WITHDRAW, :21: = demand reference (= :21: of the MT765), :23: = undertaking number
:27:1/1
:20:${newRef}
:21:${ldg_pendingDemandId|demandId}
:22D:${ldg_form|'DGAR'}
:23:${ref}
:23H:OTHERFNC
:45D:WITHDRAWAL OF DEMAND ${ldg_pendingDemandId|demandId}
UNDER UNDERTAKING ${ref}.
THE BENEFICIARY WITHDRAWS ITS DEMAND.
